Name:           zapret-desktop
Version:        @VERSION@
Release:        1%{?dist}
Summary:        GUI for DPI bypass (zapret / nfqws)
License:        MIT
URL:            https://github.com/HELLAIRSDEV/zapret-desktop
Source0:        zapret-desktop-tree.tar.gz
BuildArch:      x86_64
Requires:       nftables
Requires:       polkit
Requires:       fontconfig
Requires:       freetype
Requires:       harfbuzz
Requires:       glib2
Requires:       libX11
Requires:       libICE
Requires:       libSM
Requires:       zlib

%description
Графический интерфейс для обхода DPI (Discord, YouTube, Telegram)
на базе nfqws и nftables.

%prep
%setup -q -c -T

%install
mkdir -p %{buildroot}
tar xzf %{SOURCE0} -C %{buildroot}

%post
chmod 755 /usr/lib/zapret-desktop/bin/zapret-ctl 2>/dev/null || true
chmod 755 /usr/lib/zapret-desktop/bin/nfqws 2>/dev/null || true
update-desktop-database -q 2>/dev/null || true

%files
/usr/lib/zapret-desktop
/usr/bin/zapret-desktop
/usr/share/applications/zapret-desktop.desktop
/usr/share/icons/hicolor/256x256/apps/zapret-desktop.png
/usr/share/polkit-1/actions/org.zapret.desktop.policy

%changelog
* Thu Oct 29 2026 HELLAIRSDEV <hellairss@mail.ru> - @VERSION@-1
- Linux-порт: Avalonia UI, движок nfqws + nftables
